---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---
<Layout title="Join | ZTEIST" lang="en">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
    <h1 class="mb-10 text-3xl font-bold text-zte-navy">Join ZTEIST</h1>

    <h2 class="mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-zte-navy">Who can join</h2>
    <p class="mb-3">If you have ever worked at ZTE (ZTE Corporation) or any of its subsidiaries at home or abroad — full-time, as an intern, on expat assignment, or on secondment — you are welcome here, no matter when you left or where life has taken you.</p>
    <p class="mb-6">We draw no line by title or department. R&amp;D, marketing, HR, management, supply chain — if you came out of ZTE, there is a place for you here.</p>
    <p class="mb-10"><span class="font-semibold text-zte-blue">No proof required</span>: one member's referral is enough, or simply tell us about your experience.</p>

    <h2 class="mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-zte-navy">How to join (3 steps)</h2>
    <ol class="mb-10 list-decimal space-y-3 pl-6">
      <li><span class="font-semibold">Sign up</span> — email verification code, nickname + password, or Google sign-in.</li>
      <li><span class="font-semibold">Complete your profile</span> — country, years at ZTE, product line, role, technical direction, and more, so old colleagues can find you.</li>
      <li><span class="font-semibold">Get your personal invite code</span> — and bring more colleagues home.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2 class="mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-zte-navy">What you get</h2>
    <ul class="mb-10 space-y-3 pl-0">
      <li><span class="font-semibold text-zte-blue">Find old colleagues</span> — search by country, product line, era, and role, and reconnect with long-lost friends.</li>
      <li><span class="font-semibold text-zte-blue">Match resources</span> — supply and demand, jobs, projects; put everyone's keys on the same table.</li>
      <li><span class="font-semibold text-zte-blue">Be seen, needed, and amplified</span> — let your value be seen, needed, and amplified by others.</li>
      <li><span class="font-semibold text-zte-blue">Create together, win together, achieve together</span> — build something real, not just “know someone”.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-zte-navy">Rules &amp; expectations</h2>
    <ul class="mb-10 space-y-3 pl-0">
      <li><span class="font-semibold text-zte-blue">No spectator seats</span> — everyone who walks in is a builder.</li>
      <li><span class="font-semibold text-zte-blue">Be truthful, respect privacy, don't disturb others</span> — see <a href="/en/terms/" class="text-zte-blue underline">Terms</a>.</li>
      <li><span class="font-semibold text-zte-blue">Privacy tiers</span> — contact info is visible only to verified members, same-department colleagues, and admins — see <a href="/en/privacy/" class="text-zte-blue underline">Privacy</a>.</li>
      <li><span class="font-semibold text-zte-blue">Observation period</span> — new members start on observation and upgrade after verification.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-zte-navy">Membership tiers</h2>
    <table class="mb-8 w-full max-w-md border-collapse text-sm">
      <thead>
        <tr class="border-b border-gray-200 text-left text-zte-navy">
          <th class="py-2 pr-4 font-semibold">Tier</th>
          <th class="py-2 font-semibold">Description</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
          <td class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium">Trial</td>
          <td class="py-2">Default for new members</td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
          <td class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium">Member</td>
          <td class="py-2">After verification</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium">Expert</td>
          <td class="py-2">Coming soon</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <a href="/en/register/" class="inline-block rounded-full bg-zte-blue px-8 py-3 font-medium text-white transition-opacity hover:opacity-90">Join now →</a>
  </article>
</Layout>
